{"availability":"available","full":"tjakoen/github-native-course-platform","name":"github-native-course-platform","description":"A university coursework, quiz, and grading platform that runs entirely on GitHub Actions, with Canvas as the only external integration.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":185,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-02T22:03:43Z","updated":"2026-10-04T22:16:34Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tjakoen.github.io/github-native-course-platform/","topics":[],"demo":"https://tjakoen.github.io/github-native-course-platform/?demo=1","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:49.151Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:49.151Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T05:50:49.151Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:52:14.356Z","stars":185,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-05T05:50:49.151Z","stars":185,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A university coursework, quiz, and grading system that runs entirely on GitHub - no hosted app, no third-party LMS. The instructor drives everything from an Actions tab; students live in their own repo. Grades sync out to Canvas as a single CSV at the very end.","Built and run in production across several live university courses (front-end JS/React, Dart/Flutter, and HTML/CSS/JS), covering hundreds of student repositories per term."],"features":["GitHub is the LMS; Canvas is just the export target. Materials, quizzes, grading, and each student's personal workspace all live in Git. Canvas receives one gradebook CSV at the end.","Native over hosted. No servers to run. The instructor's UI is workflow forms in the Actions tab; the student's UI is their repo's file view and the green check marks.","Source-of-truth split. The student repo owns submissions; the teacher repo owns grades. Nothing official is ever read back from a student repo, so there is nothing to tamper with.","Grade off-repo. Grades are computed in the teacher repo from canonical tests against a snapshot commit, never from code running inside the student's repo.","Honest about integrity. Take-home work cannot be proctored. The design deters the honest majority (per-student variants, deadline snapshots, viva spot-checks) rather than pretending to prevent the determined."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjakoen/github-native-course-platform/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b049a2ffaf48a1cd2692eb4f6a97850e003bd014ad22e3fdc3df3b3062d58e83","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:14.540Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T06:38:38.977Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A university coursework, quiz, and grading system that runs entirely on GitHub - no hosted app, no third-party LMS. The instructor drives everything from an Actions tab; students live in their own repo. Grades sync out to Canvas as a single CSV at the very end.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjakoen/github-native-course-platform/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no token, no data of ours or yours involved.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjakoen/github-native-course-platform/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b049a2ffaf48a1cd2692eb4f6a97850e003bd014ad22e3fdc3df3b3062d58e83","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjakoen/github-native-course-platform/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T06:38:38.977Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T22:16:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tjakoen/github-native-course-platform/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T06:38:38.977Z","hash":"b049a2ffaf48a1cd2692eb4f6a97850e003bd014ad22e3fdc3df3b3062d58e83","originalBytes":5557,"storedBytes":5557,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","student","live","repo","course","console","attendance","canvas","github","instructor","real","see","their","three","actions","commit","csv","demo","each","grading","here","hosted","one","own","runs","tab"